1
00:00:02,840 --> 00:00:10,120
Bro, are you really going to do this? Yeah.
If I don't say it now, one day my dad will find out anyway.

2
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:18,119
I mean… you're really going to
take this seriously?

3
