But honestly, I get Earth.
He's just worried about you.

8
00:00:44,647 --> 00:00:50,232
If your family tells you guys to break up,
what are you gonna do?

9
00:00:50,621 --> 00:00:57,523
I won't break up. Simple as that.
Dude, I know you're stubborn.

10
00:00:58,602 --> 00:01:07,588
But look at me. Look at the state I'm in—
being all alone like this. And for what?
